<title>POLAND: Elektrim wins PLN 350 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Elektrim wins PLN 350 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial and trading conglomerate Elektrim SA won a contract worth about 350 million zlotys for building a section of a heating and power generating plant, Elektrim said in a statement.</p>
<p>Elektrim said in a Friday statement, the contract was likely to be signed in the first half of April.</p>
<p>The works would be carried out in Elektrocieplownia Katowice SA, it said.</p>
<p>It was not immediately clear whether Elektrim would carry the contract itself or through its subsidiaries and company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
